<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Instant download · Secure Stripe checkout</span>
      <h1>AI toolkits and playbooks you can buy and own today.</h1>
      <p class="lead">No subscription wall, no waiting list. Pick a pack, check out securely with Stripe, and the files land in your inbox. Everything here is built local-first on real GPUs — the same stack that runs ABUZ8.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#shop">Browse the store</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/tools.html">Try the free tools first</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><strong>36</strong><span>Products ready to buy now</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>$19+</strong><span>Starting price, one-time</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>Instant</strong><span>Delivered to your inbox</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>Tested</strong><span>Before it's ever sold</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ THE SHOP — 28 live Stripe products (June-10 fulfillment-wired catalog, reconciled to 28 publish) ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="shop">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Shop — instant download</h2>
      <p class="sub">Secure Stripe checkout. Files delivered to your inbox automatically. Tested before it's sold — and we'll always be honest with you. Payments processed by ABUZ8 LLC.</p>

      <div class="tier-label"><h3>Flagship</h3><span>$97 · complete systems &amp; bundles</span></div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="pack feature">
          <span class="tag best">Best value · bundle</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/revenue_empire_bundle.jpg" alt="AI Revenue Empire Bundle cover" loading="lazy"><h4>AI Revenue Empire Bundle</h4>
          <p>The flagship bundle — the core toolkits and playbooks packaged to stand up an AI-driven income stack end to end.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/00w3cnazbdqsbj18Miebu1E" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/ai-revenue-empire-bundle.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Playbook</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/ai_automation_blueprint.jpg" alt="AI Automation Blueprint cover" loading="lazy"><h4>AI Automation Blueprint</h4>
          <p>The complete framework for mapping any manual workflow to an autonomous agent — decision points, build patterns, and the operator's playbook.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/eVqbITdLndqs1Ir9Qmebu1B" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/ai-automation-blueprint.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Playbook</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/sdr_agent_playbook.jpg" alt="SDR Agent Playbook cover" loading="lazy"><h4>SDR Agent Playbook</h4>
          <p>Stand up an AI sales-development rep: prospecting, outreach sequences, and lead qualification handled by an agent.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm5kv36JbikgDl0fMebu1C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/sdr-agent-playbook.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Stack</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/sovereign_ai_stack.jpg" alt="Sovereign AI Stack cover" loading="lazy"><h4>Sovereign AI Stack</h4>
          <p>The full local-first AI stack ABUZ8 runs on — own your models, your data, and your compute end to end.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/aFa00b8r35Y086PbYuebu1D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/sovereign-ai-stack.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Course</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/mastery_pro.jpg" alt="ABUZ8 Mastery Pro cover" loading="lazy"><h4>ABUZ8 Mastery Pro</h4>
          <p>The professional operator's track — the systems, routines, and stack to run AI as a business.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/eVq9AL22Faeg2Mv2nUebu1F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/abuz8-mastery-pro.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Course</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/mastery_vip.jpg" alt="ABUZ8 Mastery VIP cover" loading="lazy"><h4>ABUZ8 Mastery VIP</h4>
          <p>Everything in Mastery Pro plus the advanced VIP track — the deepest build-and-scale playbooks.</p>
          <div class="price">$97 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/eVqfZ9fTv0DG72L6Eaebu1G" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/abuz8-mastery-vip.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tier-label"><h3>Professional</h3><span>$37–$47 · production toolkits</span></div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Toolkit</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/faceless_content_pro.jpg" alt="Faceless Content Machine Pro cover" loading="lazy"><h4>Faceless Content Machine Pro</h4>
          <p>Run a faceless content channel end to end: scripts, voice, b-roll, and a repeatable daily publishing system.</p>
          <div class="price">$47 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/3cI6ozfTv7242MvfaGebu1M" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/faceless-content-machine-pro.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Toolkit</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/video_generator.jpg" alt="AI Commercial Video Production cover" loading="lazy"><h4>AI Commercial Video Production</h4>
          <p>Produce broadcast-style commercial and product video with AI — the full generation and editing pipeline.</p>
          <div class="price">$47 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/eVq7sD36J4TW5YH2nUebu0W" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/ai-commercial-video-production.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Toolkit</span>
          <h4>Sovereign Coding Assistant</h4>
          <p>A local-first coding assistant you own — code review, generation, and docs without sending your code to the cloud.</p>
          <div class="price">$47 <span>one-time</span></div>
          <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/3cI8wH4aN9ac3Qz9Qmebu0X" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now →</a>
          <a class="details" href="/products/sovereign-coding-assistant.html">Details →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <span class="tag ready">Playbook</span>
          <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/covers/global_funnels.jpg" alt="Global Funnels cover" loading="lazy"><h4>Global Funnels</h4>
